 "transcript": "The way this industry teaches funding, it costs you $5,000 to $10,000 in hundreds of hours of outdated zoos, of outdated videos and zoom calls that will pull you away from your business. And after all of that, some of them still charge you $2,000 a month for that one piece that decides how much you get a-- They all say they want to help you, but anyone who really wanted to help you would look at your file and tell you exactly what to do next. So I built the capital blueprint, which reviews your file the way a lender does and shows you how much we think you'll qualify for right now. From there, your dashboard lays out every step to get your file to the maximum amount of funding in the exact order you need to take them. and in the exact order you need to take them. And the blueprint gets you past the exact point where most people give up on learning funding. Every step has a due date and a reminder. Each one clears only when you, only when you upload proof that you finished. A real person on our team checks in with you whenever you fall behind and once your file is ready, you're set up to find yourself. After that, the system tells you when you're ready for your next funding sequence so the blueprint becomes your own operating system for funding. You can even add your spouse or your business partner to your file. Blah blah blah. Not going to say that. Only about one in eight people finish an online course they sign up for which is why every step in the blueprint has a deadline and a person behind it. You learn funding by taking action on your own file and since you end up funded, the Blueprint is worth way more than any course. The Blueprint is built for you if you want to learn this and run this and run it yourself with a team behind you. If you rather have us handle everything, we're happy to help in whatever way fits, whether that's optimizing your credit or running your funding for you. That $2,000 a month piece is the bank data, meaning what each bank approves you, what each bank approves and why. And you get it from day one.",
